; Optional local PHP configuration template.
; Do not commit a real api-php/php.ini because extension_dir is different on each computer.
; Prefer using the active PHP config shown by:
; php --ini
;
; If you intentionally start PHP with this file, copy it to api-php/php.ini and
; update extension_dir to your own PHP ext folder first.
;
; Windows/XAMPP example:
; extension_dir="C:\xampp\php\ext"
; extension=pdo_mysql
; extension=fileinfo
